ISSUES TO BE DECIDED
The following issues have been presented before the Board:
(1) whether the Department enred in denying the deduction
for interest paid on shareholder promissory notes for tax year 2020;
(2) whether the Department violated the Montana Taxpayer Bill of Rights as
applied to the Taxpayers; and
(3) whether the Department violated the Taxpayers' due process rights.
